{id:'fvg',title:'TrendSpider · Fair Value Gap Trading Strategy',url:'https://trendspider.com/learning-center/fair-value-gap-trading-strategy/',kind:'Platform education',finding:'Describes a three-candle gap and retracement approach. This is a pattern explanation, not a controlled MNQ performance study.'},
{id:'orb',title:'Holmberg, Lönnbark & Lundström · Opening range breakout research',url:'https://swopec.hhs.se/umnees/abs/umnees0845.htm',kind:'Academic working-paper abstract · 2012',finding:'Studies a threshold-based ORB rule and reports favorable historical results in a crude-oil-futures setting. That rule and market differ from this lab’s 15-minute MNQ breakout; its findings do not supply our hit rate.'},
{id:'bands',title:'John Bollinger · Bollinger Band Rules',url:'https://www.bollingerbands.com/bollinger-band-rules',kind:'Indicator creator’s guidance',finding:'A band touch alone is not an entry signal; prices can follow a band in a trend. The 20-period, two-standard-deviation settings are defaults, not a universally validated trading system.'},
{id:'vwap',title:'Interactive Brokers · VWAP documentation',url:'https://www.interactivebrokers.com/docs/general/order-types/algorithmic-orders/ib-algorithms/vwap',kind:'Broker execution documentation',finding:'VWAP is an execution benchmark, and even a VWAP execution algorithm can miss it. This does not establish that fading every deviation toward VWAP is profitable.'},
{id:'flow',title:'Cont, Kukanov & Stoikov · The Price Impact of Order Book Events',url:'https://www.sashastoikov.com/finance/2015/3/12/the-price-impact-of-order-book-events',kind:'Author’s summary of published research',finding:'Relates order-flow imbalance to short-interval price changes using 50 U.S. stocks. Mechanism evidence is not a demonstrated 70–85% MNQ scalping hit rate or a retail latency advantage.'},
{id:'depth',title:'CME Group · Liquidity Tool methodology',url:'https://www.cmegroup.com/education/articles-and-reports/understanding-the-cme-liquidity-tool-methodology',kind:'Exchange methodology',finding:'Depth analysis uses timestamped book updates, bids, offers, sizes and cancellations. Candle OHLC and traded volume do not contain the event sequence required for a DOM replay.'},
{id:'fade',title:'Fidelity · Identifying Chart Patterns, false/failed breakouts',url:'https://www.fidelity.com/bin-public/060_www_fidelity_com/documents/learning-center/Deck_Chart%20patterns.pdf',kind:'Broker education · page 13',finding:'Defines a false breakout as a return through the breakout level and a failed breakout as a subsequent reversal. This supports a precise pattern definition, not a universal opening-fade success rate.'},
{id:'pairs',title:'Gatev, Goetzmann & Rouwenhorst · Pairs Trading',url:'https://doi.org/10.1093/rfs/hhj020',kind:'Published stock-pairs study · 2006; abstract reviewed',finding:'Tests relative-value pairs rules on historical daily stock data. A stock-pairs result cannot be imported as an ES/NQ or MES/MNQ intraday win-rate claim.'},
{id:'hedge',title:'CME Group · Stock Index Spread Opportunities',url:'https://www.cmegroup.com/education/whitepapers/stock-index-spread-opportunities',kind:'Exchange education',finding:'Inter-index spreading needs an explicit hedge ratio based on monetary exposure. Correlated indexes can still diverge in performance; equal contract counts do not ensure a neutral hedge.'}
